 "people": [
  {
   "id": "person.velho",
   "song": {"voice": "man", "title": "Salt Sea", "says": "Velho will not sing, he says, and then does: an old Lusaran song about the sea that takes men, slow and dark. He sings it well, and looks at no one while he does. Afterwards he drinks his wine in one go and goes back to being proud.", "lines": ["O salt sea, how much of your salt", "is the tears of the mothers of Lusara..."]},
   "facts": [{"id": "fact.velho_left_ship", "text": "Left the last Company ship at the coast and came home on a Brennish one; no one knows why."}, {"id": "fact.velho_mutiny", "text": "Says the master of the Santa Clara was hanging Ahuneri pilots off the river mouth, and he would not stand by."}],
   "conversation": {"first": "The Lusaran looks up from his charts, looks you over, and takes his time about it. \"You are the Garza's captain. I wondered when you would come.\"", "again": "Velho nods without getting up. \"Captain.\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.velho.charts", "ask": "Those are the Ember Coast charts?", "says": "\"Mine. Not the Chamber's: theirs put the river mouths three leagues wrong, and I have the reefs to prove it on a Lusaran hull.\" He turns the sheet so you can see the soundings, all in his own small hand.", "claims": {"skill.navigation": 5}, "respect": 4, "trust": 3}, {"id": "topic.velho.coast", "ask": "What is the coast like, in truth?", "after": ["topic.velho.charts"], "says": "\"Low. Green to the water, and the water brown for a league out where the rivers come down. You smell it before you see it. In the dry season the currents set north along the shore and will put you on the bar at Punta Ceniza if you sleep. The Ahuneri will trade if you let them come to you. Most captains do not let them.\"", "claims": {"skill.seamanship": 4, "language.ahuneri": 2}, "trust": 4}, {"id": "topic.velho.why", "ask": "Why go back?", "after": ["topic.velho.coast"], "says": "He is quiet so long you think he will not answer. \"Because I know the way, and the next man who does not will drown his crew finding it. That is enough for you.\"", "guard": {"trust": 10, "says": "\"That is my business, Captain. I said so.\" He goes back to his charts.", "change": -4}, "trust": 5, "respect": 3}, {"id": "topic.velho.brennish", "ask": "You were seen with the Brennish trader, after dark.", "known": ["fact.velho_brennish"], "says": "He puts the dividers down very carefully. \"Hob carries letters for me. To Lusara, to my sister; your Chamber reads everything that goes on a Castrenan ship. If that is a crime, tell Quintana.\"", "guard": {"trust": 12, "says": "\"You have been watching me.\" His face closes like a door. \"Then keep watching, Captain. You will learn nothing else from me today.\"", "change": -8}, "trust": 6}, {"id": "topic.velho.santa_clara", "ask": "Quintana says you left the last Company ship at the coast.", "known": ["fact.velho_left_ship"], "says": "\"The Santa Clara. Her master was hanging Ahuneri pilots off the river mouth for leading him wrong, and they had not. I told him so in front of the crew, and he put me ashore with my chest. A Brennish ship took me off a month after.\" He looks at you. \"If you are that kind of master, Captain, find another pilot.\"", "guard": {"trust": 14, "says": "\"Quintana says a great deal. Ask him why the Chamber never wrote down what that master did.\"", "change": -3}, "tells": ["fact.velho_mutiny"], "trust": 8, "respect": 6}, {"id": "topic.velho.terms", "ask": "What would you want, to pilot the Garza?", "seeking": true, "terms": true, "after": ["topic.velho.coast"], "says": "\"Sixteen hundred, in advance, and not a sueldo less: that is what a pilot who has been there is worth. And my word on the course is the last word, when it comes to shoals.\""}]},
