  {
   "id": "person.rodrigo",
   "song": {"voice": "chorus", "title": "The Abbess of Almara", "says": "Rodrigo jumps on a bench and sings a song about an abbess, a sailor and a laundry basket that is not fit for Father Anselmo's ears. The room roars. Inés throws a wet cloth at him and misses.", "lines": ["The Abbess of Almara had a basket full of linen,", "and what was in the bottom of it, sirs, was not a sin..."]},
   "conversation": {"first": "The young topman is leaning on a bollard as if it belongs to him. \"You'll be wanting me, Captain. Everyone does.\"", "again": "Rodrigo grins. \"Back again? I knew it.\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.rodrigo.aloft", "ask": "Best man aloft on the waterfront?", "says": "\"Watch me.\" He is up the shrouds of the nearest boat before you can answer, hangs by one hand from the yard, and comes down by the backstay in a breath. The dockers do not even look up; they have seen it before.", "claims": {"skill.rigging": 4, "skill.seamanship": 3}, "respect": 2}, {"id": "topic.rodrigo.islands", "ask": "Round the Lusaran islands twice?", "after": ["topic.rodrigo.aloft"], "says": "\"Twice! Well. Once round and once halfway, and we came back for the master's wife.\" He laughs at himself, which is the first thing you have liked about him.", "affection": 4, "trust": 3}, {"id": "topic.rodrigo.wat", "ask": "What do you have against the Brennish seaman?", "after": ["topic.rodrigo.aloft"], "says": "\"Harrow? He's a pirate. Interlopers, the lot of them; my uncle was on the Esperanza when the Brennish burned her.\" He spits. \"Sign him and you can find another topman.\"", "trust": 1}, {"id": "topic.rodrigo.girls", "ask": "I hear you've told half the waterfront you're sailing with me.", "after": ["topic.rodrigo.aloft"], "says": "He has the grace to colour. \"Well. You will take me, won't you?\" For a moment he looks his age, which is younger than he pretends.", "affection": 3}, {"id": "topic.rodrigo.terms", "ask": "What would you want?", "seeking": true, "terms": true, "after": ["topic.rodrigo.aloft"], "says": "\"Eight fifty. Cheap for the best, Captain.\""}]},
