  {
   "id": "person.wat",
   "song": {"voice": "man", "title": "The Lass of Brennmouth Quay", "says": "Wat stands, a little red, and sings in his own tongue, low and plain. The room does not understand a word and goes quiet anyway; even Rodrigo does not jeer. When he sits down, Inés puts a cup in front of him without being asked.", "lines": ["Oh the tide goes out at Brennmouth and the tide comes in again,", "and the lass upon the quay-wall counts the sails and counts the men..."]},
   "conversation": {"first": "The fair-haired seaman stands when you come up, which no one else on this quay does. \"Captain. They say you might not mind a Brennish hand. I'd be grateful to be wrong about that if I am.\"", "again": "Wat touches his forehead. \"Captain.\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.wat.coast", "ask": "You've sailed the Ember Coast?", "says": "\"Twice, with Brennmouth men, trading where your Chamber says we mayn't. The weather turns in an hour there: the sky goes yellow in the east and you've the time it takes to hand the topsails, no more.\"", "claims": {"skill.seamanship": 3, "skill.navigation": 2}, "trust": 4, "respect": 3}, {"id": "topic.wat.here", "ask": "Why are you on a Castrenan quay?", "after": ["topic.wat.coast"], "says": "\"My ship was taken by your coastguard off the cape. They hanged the master and turned the rest of us loose here to starve. No Castrenan master will have me, and I've no money for the passage home.\" He says it without self-pity.", "affection": 3, "trust": 4}, {"id": "topic.wat.rodrigo", "ask": "Rodrigo says you're a pirate.", "after": ["topic.wat.coast"], "says": "\"Rodrigo's uncle was on the Esperanza, I know. That was Captain Haile, and he was hanged for it at Brennmouth, by my own people. I'll not fight the lad, Captain. I'll keep my watch and he can keep his.\"", "trust": 3, "respect": 4}, {"id": "topic.wat.terms", "ask": "What would you want?", "seeking": true, "terms": true, "after": ["topic.wat.coast"], "says": "\"Seven hundred. Less, if it comes to it; I'd rather sail than starve.\""}]},
