  {
   "id": "person.ines",
   "conversation": {"first": "The landlady sizes you up from the door, keys jingling at her belt. \"Captain of the Garza! Come in, come in. There's a stool by the fire, and nobody in this town says anything I don't hear by supper.\"", "again": "\"Captain! Your stool's warm.\" Inés wipes a cup and sets it down by you.", "topics": [{"id": "topic.ines.who", "ask": "Who's looking for a ship?", "says": "\"Half my customers, since you came. The ones worth having: Velho, the Lusaran pilot, at the chart table till noon; the young topman Rodrigo, who'll tell you himself; and my own cook, Nuño, God help me.\"", "leads": ["lead.ines_velho", "lead.ines_rodrigo", "lead.ines_nuno"], "trust": 3, "affection": 2}, {"id": "topic.ines.velho", "ask": "What do you make of Velho?", "after": ["topic.ines.who"], "says": "\"Knows that coast better than any Castrenan alive, they say. Proud as a bishop. Drinks alone, pays on the nail, and goes out after dark, and none of my business where.\"", "trust": 2}, {"id": "topic.ines.pons", "ask": "And the barber, Pons?", "after": ["topic.ines.who"], "says": "\"Pons? Owes money to half the Arenal, and Grilo the other half. A good hand with a knife, mind. He set my boy's arm and it healed straight.\"", "trust": 2, "about": "person.pons", "tells": ["fact.pons_debts"]}, {"id": "topic.ines.pascual", "ask": "The young man who waits by the board, Pascual?", "after": ["topic.ines.who"], "says": "\"Pascual? His mother's the candle-seller. He's never been past the bar, whatever he tells you, the lamb.\"", "trust": 2, "about": "person.pascual", "tells": ["fact.pascual_never_sailed"]}, {"id": "topic.ines.nuno", "ask": "You'd let Nuño go?", "after": ["topic.ines.who"], "says": "She snorts. \"Let him? He'll go if I tie him to the spit. Five years he's cooked for me, and good, not as good as he says. Take him, Captain, and feed them properly. I'll find someone.\" She doesn't look at the kitchen door.", "affection": 4}]},
   "greetings": [{"standing": 1, "text": "\"Captain! There's a stool by the fire if you want to hear who's looking for a ship.\""}, {"standing": 2, "text": "\"Half my customers want a berth on the Garza now. The other half want to know where she's going.\""}],
