  {
   "id": "person.clerk_chamber",
   "conversation": {"first": "The clerk does not look up from his ledger. \"The Garza's licence is in order, Captain, if that is what you came for. If it is something else, be quick.\"", "again": "Quintana turns a page. \"Captain.\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.quintana.velho", "ask": "What does the Chamber know of the pilot Velho?", "says": "\"Velho knows his trade.\" He dips his pen. \"But he left the last Company ship at the coast and came home on a Brennish one, and he has never explained why to the Chamber's satisfaction.\"", "respect": 2, "about": "person.velho", "tells": ["fact.velho_left_ship"]}, {"id": "topic.quintana.wat", "ask": "And the Brennish seaman, Harrow?", "says": "\"An interloper's man. The Chamber would not approve, Captain, and your crew may like him less. That said, the Chamber does not sail with you.\"", "respect": 1}, {"id": "topic.quintana.tome", "ask": "The convict Tomé: what was he taken up for?", "says": "\"A knifing. The pardon is the King's, not mine; if he sails and stays a year on the coast, it is his.\" He finds the page. \"The Caridad. There was an inquiry about that ship once. Nothing came of it.\"", "respect": 1}]},
