  {
   "id": "person.hob",
   "conversation": {"first": "The red-bearded trader spreads his ringed hands. \"Captain! Best Brennish stores at half the chandler's price. Corbalán robs you; I only overcharge.\"", "again": "\"Captain! Changed your mind about my water?\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.hob.velho", "ask": "You know the pilot Velho?", "says": "Hob's smile does not change. \"I carry a letter now and then for a friend. Lusara is on my way. Is that what you wanted to know?\"", "trust": 1}, {"id": "topic.hob.water", "ask": "Is your water good?", "says": "\"Good as any.\" He meets your eye. \"Drink it soon, mind.\""}]},
