  {
   "id": "person.hernando",
   "conversation": {"first": "The docker with the Company tattoo looks up from the bale he is sitting on. \"The Garza. Going to the coast, are you.\" It is not a question, and he does not sound as if he envies you.", "again": "Hernando nods. \"Captain.\"", "topics": [{"id": "topic.hernando.coast", "ask": "You've been to the Ember Coast?", "says": "\"Last Company ship. Eleven months at Punta Ceniza. Half the crew went into the ground there. The fever comes up off the river at night: keep your men aboard after dark and give them wine, not the water.\"", "trust": 4, "respect": 2}, {"id": "topic.hernando.ximena", "ask": "Do you know Ximena, the fish seller?", "after": ["topic.hernando.coast"], "says": "\"She was at Mahenu, true enough. When we put in there, she came running down the beach to the boats like the devil was after her. A season, not a year, whatever she says, and she left in a hurry.\"", "leads": ["lead.hernando_ximena"], "trust": 2, "about": "person.ximena", "tells": ["fact.ximena_season"]}, {"id": "topic.hernando.velho", "ask": "Did you know the pilot Velho, out there?", "after": ["topic.hernando.coast"], "says": "\"He was on the Santa Clara, before us. There was a story about him and her master, but the Company men didn't tell it to us dockers.\"", "trust": 2}]},
